WEBVTT

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.276
and that's what you're seeing
here on the screen.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.193
That's all bioluminescence.
Like I said: just like fireflies.

00:00:34.217 --> 00:00:36.472
There's a flying turkey under a tree.

00:00:36.496 --> 00:00:37.506
(Laughter)

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:40.678
I'm a geologist by training.

00:00:40.702 --> 00:00:42.154
But I love that.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.429
And you see, some of the bioluminescence
they use to avoid being eaten,

00:00:46.453 --> 00:00:47.976
some they use to attract prey,

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.751
but all of it,
from an artistic point of view,

00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:52.176
is just positively amazing.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.976
And a lot of what goes on inside --

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.334
There's a fish with glowing eyes,
pulsating eyes.

00:00:56.358 --> 00:00:58.976
Some of the colors
are designed to hypnotize,

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.460
these lovely patterns.